      "objective": "Find laser flash analysis details - specimen geometry, graphite coating, sample holder, IR detector, shot sequence, k=alpha*rho*cp calculation per ASTM E1461",
      "rationale": "This addresses question 4 about LFA instruments and measurement methodology",
      "status": "pending",
      "result": null,
      "evaluation": null
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "objective": "Gather additional evidence from ASTM standards and ISO 11357 for procedural details",
